   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Education",
     "texto": [
      "**Wykształcenie wyższe** means «higher education»; **wykształcenie średnie**, «secondary education».",
      "The neuter adjective ends in **-e**, like the noun **wykształcenie**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Knowing how to do",
     "texto": [
      "**Umieć** means «to know how to do» an activity; it is followed by an infinitive: **umiem obsługiwać komputer** («I can use a computer»).",
      "**Znam** means «I know» and is used with nouns, as in **znam polski** («I know Polish»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
